    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "ABS-960+ Baggage Scale: Class III, self-indicating, single interval, non-automatic weighing instrument. May be used for direct sales to the public. Comprises an Operator Panel (OP-960+) connected to a load receptor; a Passenger Panel (PP-950-960) may also be connected via RS-485. The load receptor may be fitted with a motorised conveyor. Devices include initial zero-setting, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, zero indicator, indication of stable equilibrium, display checking at power-up, totalisation function, bag counting, acting upon significant faults, and remote operation via computer. Sealing of the Operator Panel enclosure and load cell connection is by tamper-evident method."
